@startuml
title Tests Page — Результаты и история попыток

actor User
participant "TestsPage" as Page
participant "TestController" as TC
participant "TestAttempt" as TA

User -> Page: click "Подробнее" после завершения
Page -> TC: dispatch(getAttemptResult(attemptId, userId))
TC -> TA: findByPk(attemptId, include=Questions+Answers)
TA --> TC: attempt{ score, maxScore, questions[]{ text, isCorrect, userAnswer, correctAnswer } }
TC --> Page: attempt
Page --> User: рендер детального результата (по каждому вопросу)

User -> Page: click "Мои попытки"
Page -> TC: dispatch(getMyAttempts(testId, userId))
TC -> TA: findAll(testId, userId, order=DESC)
TA --> TC: attempts[]{ id, score, maxScore, finishedAt }
TC --> Page: attempts[]
Page --> User: рендер таблицы попыток

@enduml
